    <p>Three of these four chapters strengthen the framework by bounding it. One of them &mdash; entropy
      &mdash; is a loss, recorded as a loss. A reader deciding what to make of the whole volume could
      reasonably start here, read Chapter 18 first, and judge everything else by whether the rest of the
      work is written with the same honesty.</p>
